cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CAMEO: Catalog of Architecture Metadata and Experimental Outcomes"
message: "If you use CAMEO, please cite it as below. To credit one study, use Cite on that study's page."
abstract: "An open database of model searches. Each study is one JSON file holding every model a search tried: the code that builds it, how it was trained, and how it scored."
authors:
